<title>USA: Media General selling TV station.</title>
<headline>Media General selling TV station.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media General Inc said Thursday it had agreed to sell WUTR-TV in Utica, N.Y., to Utica Television Partners for $7.75 million.</p>
<p>The sale is subject to regulatory approval and is expected to close this summer, Media General said.</p>
</text>
